      "boundElements": [],
      "text": "- 100M new links/month, 1B redirects/day\n- Redirect p99 < 100 ms\n- 99.99% for redirects; creation degrades first\n- Unique codes (strong); new link live in ~1 s\n- Click counts may lag a few minutes\n- A created link is never lost\n- Rate-limit creation; block malicious URLs",
      "originalText": "- 100M new links/month, 1B redirects/day\n- Redirect p99 < 100 ms\n- 99.99% for redirects; creation degrades first\n- Unique codes (strong); new link live in ~1 s\n- Click counts may lag a few minutes\n- A created link is never lost\n- Rate-limit creation; block malicious URLs",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
