      "versionNonce": 982878710,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "updated": 1794999035619,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "text": "- Writes: 100M/month ≈ 40/s (~100/s peak)  →  one store handles it\n- Reads: 1B/day ≈ 12K/s (~50K/s peak)  →  cache in front of the store\n- Read:write ≈ 300:1  →  optimise the read path\n- Storage: 6B rows × 500 B ≈ 3 TB (≈ 9 TB replicated)  →  shard by key\n- Cache: 10M hot links × 500 B ≈ 5 GB  →  one Redis node + replicas\n- Code length: 62^6 ≈ 57B > 6B  →  7 base62 chars gives headroom",
      "originalText": "- Writes: 100M/month ≈ 40/s (~100/s peak)  →  one store handles it\n- Reads: 1B/day ≈ 12K/s (~50K/s peak)  →  cache in front of the store\n- Read:write ≈ 300:1  →  optimise the read path\n- Storage: 6B rows × 500 B ≈ 3 TB (≈ 9 TB replicated)  →  shard by key\n- Cache: 10M hot links × 500 B ≈ 5 GB  →  one Redis node + replicas\n- Code length: 62^6 ≈ 57B > 6B  →  7 base62 chars gives headroom",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "aH"
    },
