      "versionNonce": 549067562,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "updated": 1794999035619,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "text": "- Storage is small (~9 TB); most cost is redirect servers + cache\n- One region with replicas; multi-region only for a global latency target\n- Alert on redirect p99, 5xx rate, cache hit rate, Kafka consumer lag\n- Canary rollouts for the redirect service (it's on every click)\n- Store TTL can lag days → redirect also checks expires_at\n- Abuse: rate limits, blocklist on create, async scan of new links",
      "originalText": "- Storage is small (~9 TB); most cost is redirect servers + cache\n- One region with replicas; multi-region only for a global latency target\n- Alert on redirect p99, 5xx rate, cache hit rate, Kafka consumer lag\n- Canary rollouts for the redirect service (it's on every click)\n- Store TTL can lag days → redirect also checks expires_at\n- Abuse: rate limits, blocklist on create, async scan of new links",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "aK"
    },
