      "boundElements": [],
      "text": "POST /urls   (auth token, Idempotency-Key)\n{ long_url, custom_alias?, expires_at? }\n→ 201 { short_url } · 409 alias taken\n\nGET /{short_code}\n→ 302 Location · 404 · 410 expired\n\nGET /urls/{short_code}/stats  (stretch)\n→ 200 { clicks }\n\n302, not 301: every click stays countable",
      "originalText": "POST /urls   (auth token, Idempotency-Key)\n{ long_url, custom_alias?, expires_at? }\n→ 201 { short_url } · 409 alias taken\n\nGET /{short_code}\n→ 302 Location · 404 · 410 expired\n\nGET /urls/{short_code}/stats  (stretch)\n→ 200 { clicks }\n\n302, not 301: every click stays countable",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
