      "text": "- Redirect publishes the click\n  event async; never waits\n- Aggregator writes counts per\n  minute\n- Viral link → pre-count in memory\n  on redirect servers, flush\n  every few seconds\n\nTrade-off: at-least-once → counts\nare approximate",
